# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python (extraction scripts and local tooling)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
.venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary assets are the PRODUCT of this repository and are intentionally NOT
# ignored. Screenshots (.png, .jpg, .webp), self-contained HTML, CSS, and JSON
# are all meant to be committed. Do not add blanket image or asset ignores.
#
# The patterns below are the opposite: a safety net. This is a PUBLIC
# repository, and the asset types listed here must never be committed here,
# because they are proprietary and live only in the separate private
# repository. This covers commercial fonts, and video or audio captured from
# analyzed products. Keeping them ignored means a copyrighted binary cannot be
# added to the public repo by accident.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/real-assets/fonts/
**/real-assets/video/
**/real-assets/audio/
**/real-assets/source/
**/recording/*.webm
**/recording/*.mp4
**/*.woff2
**/*.otf
**/*.ttf
**/*.mp3
**/*.wav
